desc(
	mode: "ssa"
	language: "python"
	title: "数据流：Python SSRF: User Input Used as Request URL"
	title_zh: "数据流：Python SSRF：用户输入作为请求 URL"
	type: vuln
	level: ""
	rule_id: "ssa-python-ssrf-request"
	risk: "ssrf"
	cwe: "CWE-918"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 漏洞描述
请求参数直接作为 `requests` 或 `urllib` 的目标 URL。攻击者可访问内网服务、云元数据地址。

### 检测方式
跟踪 Flask/Django 请求参数到 `requests.get/post/request`、`urllib.request.urlopen` 的实参。URL 经过 `urlparse` 等解析校验时跳过。

### 风险类型
ssrf
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
解析 URL 后校验 scheme 与 hostname，只允许白名单目标：

```python
parsed = urllib.parse.urlparse(url)
if parsed.scheme != "https" or parsed.hostname not in ALLOWED_HOSTS:
    abort(400)
```

同时禁止重定向（`allow_redirects=False`），并在网络层限制可访问网段。
SOLUTION
	reference: <<<REFERENCE
[CWE-918: Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF)](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/918.html)
REFERENCE
	alert_min: 1
)

request.args.get(* as $src)
request.form.get(* as $src)
request.values.get(* as $src)
request.GET.get(* as $src)
request.POST.get(* as $src)

requests.get(* as $arg)
requests.post(* as $arg)
requests.request(* as $arg)
urllib.request.urlopen(* as $arg)
$arg?{<self> #{include: <<<CODE
* & $src as $__next__
CODE
}->}?{!(<self><getUsers()>?{opcode: call && (<self><getCallee>?{have: /(?i)(urlparse|parse_qs|validators)/})})}?{!(<self><getUsers()>?{opcode: eq})}?{!(<self><getUsers()>?{opcode: neq})} as $hit

alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "Python SSRF: User Input Used as Request URL",
	title_zh: "Python SSRF：用户输入作为请求 URL",
	risk: "ssrf",
}

desc(
	lang: python
	alert_high: 1
	'file://unsafe_ssrf.py': <<<UNSAFE
import requests
from flask import request

def fetch():
    url = request.args.get("url", "")
    return requests.get(url, timeout=3).text
UNSAFE
	'safefile://safe_ssrf.py': <<<SAFE
from urllib.parse import urlparse
import requests
from flask import abort, request

def fetch():
    url = request.args.get("url", "")
    host = urlparse(url).hostname
    if urlparse(url).scheme != "https" or host != "api.example.internal":
        abort(400)
    return requests.get(url, timeout=3, allow_redirects=False).text
SAFE
)
